herdr-setup
Layout, mods and configuration for Herdr App (https://herdr.dev).

The mods desktop-agents, desktop-changes, desktop-chrome, desktop-files, desktop-menu, desktop-pane,
desktop-spaces and desktop-tabs started as copies of mods shipped with Herdr App (their mod.json records
"cloned_from") and have been modified in this repository. Herdr App and its shipped mods are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE.

Everything else in this repository is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 as well.
